  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sanitation and Hygiene Programme in Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase coverage of improved hygiene and sanitation for an additional 3 million people (NutSen)To increase use of toilets and handwashing by providing rural communities with hygiene and sanitation promotion.  This will benefit 5 million people and reduce water borne diseases. This programme aims to achieve MDG 7 target on sanitation coverage for Zambia by increasing use of improved toilets and will result in a 3% reduction in diarrhoea in children under 5 by 2015</narrative>
  </description>
